I was attempting to reuse some code that was ingesting Declarations.yaml, and it was complaining that simple_type was not set. Why wasn't it set? Well, that's because the script I was running had loaded the YAML file from scratch, rather than use load_aten_declarations, which adds in a bunch of extra information to Declarations.yaml after loading it:
    # enrich declarations with additional information
    selected_declarations = []
    for declaration in declarations:
