        for arg in declaration['arguments']:
            arg['simple_type'] = get_simple_type(arg)
        for ret in declaration['returns']:
            ret['simple_type'] = get_simple_type(ret)

We... probably shouldn't do this? This is a code smell suggesting downstream clients might need this information too, but aren't getting it easily.

